msgid ""
"After a summer break and little bit of COVID-19 delay, we will finally have "
"the 60th(!) Quarkus Insights episode on Monday the 23rd August."
msgstr ""

msgid "image:60th.webp[]"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"For those who don't know, Quarkus Insights is a (almost) weekly video/audio "
"podcast where we host people from all parts of the Quarkiverse to sit down "
"and talk about how to use Quarkus, what is coming next, user stories from "
"the actual users and more!"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"This Monday is titled \"The Rise of Platforms\" where Alexey will come by "
"and talk about the improvements and changes we've done around the notion of "
"Quarkus Platforms and Extensions for Quarkus 2.x."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"We have a whole backlog of 60 episodes which for large part are still as "
"relevant as they were when we recorded them."
msgstr ""

msgid "You can browse and see the full list at http://quarkus.io/insights/."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Definitely worth a watch if you want to learn about Quarkus and how it is "
"developed."
msgstr ""

msgid "This Monday is also start of \"Season 3\" - see you there!"
msgstr ""

msgid "Have fun,\n"
"Max"
msgstr ""
